  "title": "wiretap: Add some comments about seeking",
  "description": "Indicate that if a module uses wtap_dump_file_seek that it should\nset writing_must_seek to true in its file_type_subtype_info, and\nthat seeking is not supported when writing compressed files.\n\nWe don't support wtap_dump_file_tell when writing compressed streams\neither, although we could.",
